82
00:08:45.340 --> 00:08:52.450
Here's what makes this structurally different from current lobbying: in the current system, money and influence are inseparable.

83
00:08:53.020 --> 00:08:57.520
Give money, get influence over where the money goes, use that to get more money.

84
00:08:58.120 --> 00:09:03.120
The loop is opaque and self-reinforcing. I.A.B.s break the loop.

85
00:09:03.720 --> 00:09:07.440
Investors give money and get money back (ten percent revenue share).

86
00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:14.580
