89
00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:32.960
The corruption is capped at twenty percent, transparent, and completely separated from the public goods funding.

90
00:09:33.620 --> 00:09:40.080
Name a government budget that can say the same. Worked Example: How Senator Smith Votes Yes.

